f=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布新款Mac Mini与Mac Studio，首发2纳米M6芯片并推出M5 Ultra</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/85d81b2a2ac61ed8d6d5abd4ccece0b9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果正式发布新一代Mac桌面电脑，核心聚焦AI算力升级。新款Mac Mini首发2纳米工艺M6芯片，配备12核CPU/GPU及双16核神经网络引擎，LLM提示词处理速度较M4提升4.8倍。针对专业领域，苹果推出采用“四Die”架构的M5 Ultra芯片，最高支持36核CPU、80核GPU及512GB统一内存，内存带宽达1.2TB/s，官方称其AI GPU算力为M3 Ultra的4.5倍，具备本地运行数千亿参数大模型的能力。新款Mac Studio支持多机集群连接，通过共享内存池加载超大规模模型。价格方面，Mac Mini起售价上调至6999元，Mac Studio Ultra起售价为5499美元，顶配版售价超1.8万美元。512GB统一内存版Mac Studio Ultra预计10月末发售。此次硬件升级标志着苹</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达斥资60亿美元联手Poolside开发Nemotron开源AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2842940a916071785fed87a4a0d02918.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正投入60亿美元研发全球最强大的开源AI模型之一，并与Poolside达成深度合作。英伟达将获得Poolside的技术授权，并调动100多名员工全力投入Nemotron项目。此外，英伟达向Poolside追加10亿美元投资，使其投前估值达到120亿美元。此次战略布局旨在通过开源路径，直接挑战DeepSeek、Kimi等中国开源领军企业，并与OpenAI、Anthropic等美国前沿AI实验室展开竞争。英伟达此举凸显了其在开源模型领域的战略重心，通过整合Poolside的技术资源与自身算力优势，意图在高性能开源模型市场占据主导地位，对全球AI竞争格局产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX斥资600亿美元完成对AI编程工具公司Cursor的收购</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09656903ecd9ae90ac93424907c5c568.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX已正式完成对AI编程工具公司Cursor的收购，交易金额高达600亿美元。马斯克在内部会议中承认SpaceX人工智能部门目前落后于Anthropic等竞争对手，并强调将持续大规模囤积算力以攻克核心技术。双方自今年4月签署技术共享与算力合作协议后，Cursor已获得充裕预算以推进对标GitHub的Origin项目及相关测试版研发，并共同投入新版Grok模型及AI智能体的开发。此次深度整合伴随着显著的人员动荡，包括多名高层离职及Graphite团队核心成员流失，公司同时调整了股权兑现政策、薪酬方案及部分高层职级。目前，Cursor原高管团队已正式进入SpaceX AI担任要职，双方团队整合工作全面展开。此前，Cursor因毛利率为负导致融资受阻，此次并购旨在通过SpaceX的算力支持解决业务扩张瓶颈。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI自研Jalapeno芯片性能曝光，测试显示全面反超英伟达GB300</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7d9edadc63c9abf5e536b8b6cc12fd1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于8月25日正式披露其自研芯片Jalapeno，内部测试数据显示该芯片在多项核心指标上已全面超越英伟达旗舰级硬件GB300系列。Jalapeno在单位功耗下的AI工作负载处理效率及数据响应速度方面表现优异，能够以更低能耗应对高并发、大吞吐量的生成式AI训练与推理任务。此次突破标志着OpenAI在底层基础设施建设上实现关键进展，通过软硬件深度协同优化，旨在解决大模型规模化增长带来的算力成本与供应链安全痛点。业内分析认为，Jalapeno的出现不仅证明了OpenAI具备与传统硬件巨头竞争的实力，也将对全球半导体产业及算力市场格局产生深远影响，预示着AI基础设施领域的竞争将进一步加剧。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic拟于2026年秋季启动IPO，目标募资千亿美元并锚定2万亿估值</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic计划于2026年秋季正式启动IPO，拟募资1000亿美元，并将公司估值锚定在2万亿美元。为支撑该估值，Anthropic在招股书中提出了30万亿美元的潜在市场规模（TAM）预测，该数字基于全球可被AI替代的工作经济价值与劳动力成本计算，超过了SpaceX此前创下的28.5万亿美元纪录。财务表现方面，Anthropic二季度单季营收达116亿美元，且首次实现调整后营业利润转正，市场预期其年化收入有望在年底冲击千亿美元。尽管财务数据强劲，但分析师指出，受美数据中心建设受阻及海外低价模型竞争加剧影响，二级市场对超高估值的容错率正在降低。该30万亿市场蓝图能否获得资本市场认可，仍需等待9月正式披露的招股书进行验证。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
